  (text "C6, C8: ordinary aluminium electrolytics (their ESR damps the LC filter).\\nFilter 47 uH + 1000 uF: -9 dB @ 1.45 kHz scan rate, -36 dB @ 11.6 kHz (calculated).\\nGND_IN only touches J1, D1, C5, FB2. The main GND plane starts after FB2.\\nWire J1 to where panel board 1 takes its power, not at the PSU terminals.\\nD2 blocks the ESP32 board's USB 5 V from back-feeding the display (board sees ~4.5 V)."
    (at 20.32 78.74 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid e15b54aa-6755-42bb-a11f-4b7ef9680d02))
