  (text "Hat J2 pin n sits on CoreBoard J2 pin n (same numbering as the Espressif user guide).\\nUsed:  GPIO47 CLK, GPIO48 R, GPIO45 G, GPIO46 B, GPIO43 LAT, GPIO44 GCLK, GPIO40 A, GPIO42 B, GPIO39 C.\\nAvoided: GPIO4 (also ETH_INTN via R83), GPIO36/37/60/61 (strapping), GPIO58/59 (UART0 console),\\n         GPIO60 (RGB LED). Free spares: GPIO0-3, 20-25, 35, 38, 49.\\n3V3 pins 35/36 unused. 5V pins 39/40 are fed from the hat (+5V_ESP)."
    (at 20.32 195.58 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid ec8132d4-ba32-4a9a-aea2-3f01c901d2ff))
  (text "LEVEL SHIFTERS  3.3 V -> 5 V  (SN74AHCT125, TTL inputs; 33 R series into the ribbon)"
