  (text "Pin 1 = red copy (bit-exact copy of pin 4, own buffer gate).\\nPins 12/14/16 = GND (measured).\\nPins 5/13/15 unknown: NOT connected until metered.\\nPanel inputs: 5 V HC logic (SN74HC244 buffers).\\nStable to ~19.5 MHz; 18 MHz recommended."
    (at 309.88 167.64 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 4f616e11-4fbf-4ac4-a3af-24813e1ed847))
  (text "MECHANICAL"
    (at 309.88 187.96 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.778 1.778)
        (thickness 0.3556) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid d26e218d-ed69-4122-97ce-517774b8eae7))
  (text "4x M2.5 on 58 x 48 mm (CoreBoard holes: 3.0 mm, GND).\\nStack: 2.54 mm header plastic + 8.5 mm socket = 11 mm.\\nUse M2.5 x 11 mm standoffs.\\nCut-out over the RJ45 and side-mount USB-A (13+ mm tall).\\n3.2 mm holes give access to BOOT and RST.\\nNo copper over the module antenna (left edge)."
    (at 309.88 215.9 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 092f17bb-f9e7-4dbe-8ef0-bd3192016af4))
  (text "Firmware (firmware/src/pins.h) for the ESP32-S31 board. The S3 pins 5-8 and 15-18 are not on this header:"
    (at 167.64 15.24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
        (thickness 0.254) bold)
